### Redaction proof: all three sensitive values are in one request
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer auth-secret-demo
x-api-key: api-secret-demo

{
  "name": "Day 60 Redaction Check",
  "address": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "phone": "+251911234567"
}

### Request-ID proof and real order creation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: day60-order-check-001

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customer": "Day 60 Test",
  "area": "Bole",
  "teleBirrPhone": "+251911234567",
  "lines": [
    { "dishId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}
